---
---

<div class="guardrail-banner" role="region" aria-label="Evidence guardrails and non-negotiable limitations">
  <div class="banner-badge">
    <span class="pulse-indicator"></span>
    <strong>STRICT EVIDENCE GUARDRAILS ACTIVE</strong>
  </div>
  <div class="banner-content">
    <p class="banner-title">Empirical Data Boundaries Enforced Under AGENTS.md Protocol</p>
    <div class="guardrail-grid">
      <div class="guardrail-item">
        <span class="item-icon">✕</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Zero Grain Arrivals:</strong>
          <span>Arrival panel (3,892 rows) contains produce only. 71 'dhan' matches are Coriander Green (Hara Dhaniya). No foodgrain flows exist in open feed.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="guardrail-item">
        <span class="item-icon">✕</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Paddy Arrivals Null:</strong>
          <span>AGMARKNET paddy price series (53 rows) has 100% null arrival quantities. Modal price (Rs. 2,320 MSP) available; volumes cannot be inferred.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="guardrail-item">
        <span class="item-icon">✕</span>
        <div>
          <strong>National Stocks Only:</strong>
          <span>DFPD buffer stock (100 rows) is India Central Pool only (state=NaN). Facility/district silo inventories are not published.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="guardrail-item">
        <span class="item-icon">✕</span>
        <div>
          <strong>No Hoarding Claims:</strong>
          <span>Statistical deviations indicate investigation prompts, never hoarding conclusions. Actor-level hoarding rankings are strictly prohibited.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .guardrail-banner {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26, 34, 46, 0.95), rgba(15, 20, 28, 0.98));
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-amber-500);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-5);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .banner-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-amber-400);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .pulse-indicator {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--color-amber-400);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--color-amber-400);
  }

  .banner-title {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .guardrail-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .guardrail-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .item-icon {
    color: var(--color-amber-400);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .guardrail-item strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }
</style>
